114
00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:01.165
Really? I'm wearing white!

115
00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:03.082
Shut up and get down on your knees.

116
00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:06.415
I am very happy to see
you too, my wild cat.

117
00:10:08.458 --> 00:10:09.540
