139
00:11:14.166 --> 00:11:15.249
Okay.

140
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:18.957
Ifyou don't cooperate with us...

141
00:11:19.541 --> 00:11:24.415
believe me, along with the prison term.
you'll aIso get the death penalty.

142
00:11:27.416 --> 00:11:29.207
